#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75 index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This handbook describes &kdeprint;. &kdeprint; is not a standalone program. "
"It is the new printing framework for &kde; 2.2. &kdeprint; is an "
"intermediate layer between &kde; (or other) applications and the selected "
"(and installed) print subsystem of your OS (&OS;)."
msgstr ""

